        },
        {
            "id": 13889,
            "question_id": 16850,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Побудуй речення про попередній процес у Past Perfect Continuous. Почни з підмета головної частини; часові та причинні обставини не перенось на початок. Студенти вслухалися не в зміни вимови.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13890,
            "question_id": 16850,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Reject pronunciation changes as the object they were listening for.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13891,
            "question_id": 16850,
            "provider": "polyglot-v3",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: listen. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:05.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13892,
